# (sqNetAnyWatch's dead code, FreeSpace.h) with its last word the branch back, and the hooked
# instruction becomes a branch to it. Every original, caves and hooks alike, comes from a RAM dump
# of vanilla Brawl on the character select (2026-11-18), because the loader relocates words in
